          "zIndex": "10",
          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.5px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.45; text-align:left; word-wrap:break-word; font-style:italic;\">Native wildflower beds planted along the South Meadow trailhead.</div>",
          "imgSrc": "",
