        {
          "id": "pub-el-b1-0064",
          "left": "82px",
          "top": "842px",
          "width": "630px",
          "height": "164px",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": "6",
          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:12px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.55; text-align:left; word-wrap:break-word; \"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">Every third Saturday since 2014, Marcus and Priya have unlocked the Club Kitchen at 6:30 AM to flip buttermilk pancakes for over 180 neighbors. Their monthly breakfasts have raised more than $29,000 for local youth scholarships and senior shuttle passes.</p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#0f5c57;\">Join the Kitchen Crew:</strong> Help pour coffee or clear tables for one 2-hour shift this winter. Sign up with Hospitality Chair Rosa Delgado at hospitality@maplegroveclub.org.</p></div>",
